> > to have been upgraded I'm not sure how.  Is it possible for me to upgrade

> > from 7.1 to cooker?  If so, how?

> I'll let someone else answer that one.

It _is_ possible, but it can be hairy. Cooker is running on Glibc 2.2,

which is different from 7.1. This will be the main hurdle. For the rest,

it runs OK (I use it as a server, I haven't played with X on it for a

while). The 2.4 kernel does crash my box now & then, something seems to

be wrong with the automounter for some reason. It's on our list to

investigate this (fixing the installer is also on our list)...

Stefan van der Eijk

